# UI Altars (Sanitized)

High-level altar interface guidance retained for public archival.

## Overview
- Describes altar interaction touchpoints without enumerating secure flows.
- Highlights modular UI responsibilities shared across altar scenes.
- Emphasizes alignment with accessibility and localization guidelines.

## Sanitized Notes
- Specific altar rituals, progression triggers, and reward routing have been removed.
- Flowcharts, state diagrams, and diagnostic commands remain in the confidential design vault.
- Use internal UI playbooks for full sequence charts and validation rules.
